{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-zebra-prescription-printer-power-supply-units-2607-0208","content_id":"91e75f0c-5389-4bda-9010-6880863cc936","description":"Product Recall for Zebra Prescription Printer Power Supply Units presenting a high risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"19b57343-4aef-482c-87b9-fd4d5ad6d9ff","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-28T12:51:04+01:00","id":"19b57343-4aef-482c-87b9-fd4d5ad6d9ff","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-28T12:51:04+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aba54a7997a4b2950ccefca/2607-0208-product-recall-Zebra-prescription-printer.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Zebra Prescription Printer Power Supply Units</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk of fire occurring at the power lead where it enters the appliance.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product was subject to a product recall in 2016. The recall period has been expanded to include PSUs manufactured between October 1, 2006 and December 31, 2012.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Extension/Power Supply Cords</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>GK420d</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Range of Desktop Printer models that may be affected</td>\n      <td>APxxx, GC4xxx, GK4xxx, GK888xx, GX4xxx, GT8xx, HC100, H/LP/TLP/Rxxxx (282x, 284x, 384x), PS4000, T2xxx, Thermal 284x, ZP4xx, ZP5xx</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Range of Card Printer models that may be affected</td>\n      <td>BR1xxx, CN1xxx, J1xxx, P1xxx, SC1xxx, WM1xxx, ZXP Series 1, ZXP Series 3x</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>The product is a power supply unit supplied for a specialised printing device designed for healthcare environments to produce legal, highly legible medical prescriptions, repeat re-order forms, or drug dispensing labels. Power Supply Unit supplied by FSP Group.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_19b57343-4aef-482c-87b9-fd4d5ad6d9ff\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aba54a7997a4b2950ccefca/2607-0208-product-recall-Zebra-prescription-printer.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of fire occurring at the power lead where it enters the appliance.</p>\n\n<p>PSUs that serve as the power source for the above-named models of Zebra printers have been identified as potentially containing an improperly mixed phosphorus compound that is used in the flame retardant resin in the DC power supply connectors. This deficiency in the phosphorus based connector resin, when combined with moisture and humidity over time, can potentially lead to overheating or a fire hazard.</p>\n\n<p>The product was placed on the market before the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 came into force and therefore the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 1994 duties apply.</p>\n\n<p>The PSU does not comply with the core requirements outlined in Regulation 5 and Schedule 3 of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 1994 specifically related to the general requirement to be “Safe” and for Protection Against Hazards (Non-Electrical) and Resistance to External Influences.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product was subject to a product recall in 2016.</p>\n\n<p>The recall period has been expanded to include PSUs manufactured between October 1, 2006 and December 31, 2012.</p>\n\n<p>Users are advised to check if their PSU is affected and refer to the manufacturer’s recall page for further information: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.zebra.com/gb/en/power-supply-recall.html\">Power Supply Unit Voluntary Recall - Zebra</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2607-0208</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Health and Safety Executive</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-28T16:01:17Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-28","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-28T17:01:17+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-zebra-prescription-printer-power-supply-units-2607-0208","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-zebra-prescription-printer-power-supply-units-2607-0208","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-zebra-prescription-printer-power-supply-units-2607-0208","content_id":"91e75f0c-5389-4bda-9010-6880863cc936","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-28T16:01:17Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Zebra Prescription Printer Power Supply Units (2607-0208)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safe